      {
        "kind": "narrative",
        "text": "For SFO–Bangkok on January 15, 2027, the clearest choice is between reaching Bangkok the evening of January 16 and taking a later departure from San Francisco for a January 17 arrival. Both are economy awards booked as a single award through Aeroplan, at the same quoted points level; the trade-off is schedule, not cabin.",
        "reference_kind": null,
        "reference_id": null,
        "label": null,
        "claims": []
      },
      {
        "kind": "reference",
        "text": "This gets you in the previous local calendar day, at the cost of leaving SFO 11 hours 30 minutes earlier.",
        "reference_kind": "journey",
        "reference_id": "cc11925bdbf1b454bd01da92f122569d8f1caab2a21cc915493675159f29111a",
        "label": "Earlier Bangkok arrival",
        "claims": []
      },
      {
        "kind": "narrative",
        "text": "By contrast, the later-start option leaves at 11:15 p.m. on January 15 and arrives at 9:50 a.m. on January 17. Its elapsed journey is only five minutes shorter, but it arrives 11 hours 25 minutes later than the earlier-arrival choice. Choose between a more convenient SFO departure and getting to Bangkok sooner—not on the small difference in elapsed time alone.",
        "reference_kind": null,
        "reference_id": null,
        "label": null,
        "claims": []
      },
