      {
        "kind": "narrative",
        "text": "If business class matters more than a short, straightforward trip, there is also a Turkish award through LAX and Istanbul. It leaves SFO at 6:18 a.m. on January 15 and reaches Bangkok at 8:50 a.m. on January 17—a 35-hour-32-minute journey. The cabin is listed as business, but this is a very different proposition from the single-award Aeroplan choices.",
