      {
        "kind": "narrative",
        "text": "The economy Turkish alternative J27 uses the same SFO departure time and the same LAX positioning flight, but reaches Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. on January 17—4 hours 35 minutes earlier than the business option. Within Turkish’s program, that economy award is 110,000 points versus 275,000 for business, a difference of 165,000 Turkish points. So business does not buy a quicker arrival here; it costs more points and arrives later, while still requiring the LAX positioning arrangement.",
