        "kind": "narrative",
        "text": "The results were observed on October 9, 2026, not checked in real time. Award-seat counts and fares may change, and a search result is not a guarantee of bookability. The Aeroplan award price scopes are unreported, so the quoted points and taxes do not establish an all-in party total. For the LAX alternatives, the SFO–LAX cash leg and onward award are separate tickets; the positioning quote’s price scope is also unknown, and the award taxes and seat evidence for the business option are unreported. Allow for the risk of missed connections and verify baggage, check-in, terminal and transit arrangements yourself; protection between those tickets is not established. The business-cabin listing is journey-level evidence, not confirmation of the cabin on each flight.",
